  "description": "Bouncy Block Deluxe – Cute Bubble Display Font\nBouncy Block Deluxe is a bold, fun, and playful bubble display font designed to make your creative projects stand out. Its rounded chunky letters are perfect for kids-themed designs, branding, t-shirts, stickers, logos, posters, YouTube thumbnails, and more.\nYou Will Receive\n• OTF Font File\n• TTF Font File\nIncluded Characters\n• Uppercase Letters (A–Z)\n• Lowercase Letters (a–z)\n• Numbers (0–9)\nPerfect For\n• Kids Designs\n• T-Shirts\n• Stickers\n• Logos\n• Branding\n• Posters\n• School Projects\n• Nursery Designs\n• Cricut Projects\n• Silhouette Projects\n• Social Media Graphics\n• YouTube Thumbnails\nFeatures\n• Bold Bubble Style\n• Easy to Install\n• Multilingual Support\n• PUA Encoded\n• Compatible with Windows & Mac\nThank you for choosing Bouncy Block Deluxe. We hope you enjoy creating amazing designs with this fun and playful font!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bouncy Block Deluxe – Cute Bubble Display Font</p>\n<p>Bouncy Block Deluxe is a bold, fun, and playful bubble display font designed to make your creative projects stand out. Its rounded chunky letters are perfect for kids-themed designs, branding, t-shirts, stickers, logos, posters, YouTube thumbnails, and more.</p>\n<p>You Will Receive</p>\n<p>• OTF Font File<br>\n• TTF Font File</p>\n<p>Included Characters</p>\n<p>• Uppercase Letters (A–Z)<br>\n• Lowercase Letters (a–z)<br>\n• Numbers (0–9)</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>• Kids Designs<br>\n• T-Shirts<br>\n• Stickers<br>\n• Logos<br>\n• Branding<br>\n• Posters<br>\n• School Projects<br>\n• Nursery Designs<br>\n• Cricut Projects<br>\n• Silhouette Projects<br>\n• Social Media Graphics<br>\n• YouTube Thumbnails</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<p>• Bold Bubble Style<br>\n• Easy to Install<br>\n• Multilingual Support<br>\n• PUA Encoded<br>\n• Compatible with Windows &amp; Mac</p>\n<p>Thank you for choosing Bouncy Block Deluxe. We hope you enjoy creating amazing designs with this fun and playful font!</p>",
